\"k-wz\">西服；洋装；西式服装</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">衣服</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">衣服；衣着；服装</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">夕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>傍晚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうがた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">傍晚；黄昏（通常指下午三点至六点）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕飯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晚餐；晚饭；夜饭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕べ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうべ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">傍晚；黄昏；（特殊活动的）夜晚；昨晚；昨天傍晚</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">借</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>借入；租借</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.りる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">借りる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かりる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">借用；租借；租用；雇用；借助；利用（他人的帮助、智慧等）；挪作他用；改作他用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">借金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゃっきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">债务；贷款；负债；借款；（棒球）负场多于胜场的场数差；负胜差</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">借り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">借款；债务；贷款</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">曜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>星期</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">火曜日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かようび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">星期二</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">金曜日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんようび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">星期五</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">月曜日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げつようび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">星期一</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">飲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>喝；吸（烟）；服用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン・オン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">の.む・-の.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飲む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">喝</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飲み物</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のみもの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">饮料；饮品</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湯飲み</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆのみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">茶杯；茶盏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>肉；肉类</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ニク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肉；肉；荤；果肉；果实的肉质部分；肉体；血肉之躯（相对于精神）；厚度；厚实的程度；内容；实质；内在的东西；印泥</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牛肉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎゅうにく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牛肉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鶏肉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とりにく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鸡肉；家禽肉；禽肉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>借出；出借</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.す・か.し-・かし-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貸す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出借；借出；出租；租出；交给；递给</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貸し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">借贷；出租；租赁；人情；恩惠；债务；义务；债权人；借贷方式；贷方</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貸間</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かしま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出租房间；可出租的房间</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">堂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>厅堂；殿堂</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">食堂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょくどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">食堂；餐厅；饭厅；餐馆；餐厅；小吃店</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">講堂</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">礼堂；讲堂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">堂々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">堂皇；宏大；气派；庄严；雄伟；威严；肃穆；光明正大；坦荡；公开；理直气壮；厚颜无耻；堂堂正正地；大胆地；自信地；光明正大地；坦率地；毫无保留地；厚颜无耻地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鳥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>鸟；鸡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鳥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鸟；鸡肉；禽肉；家禽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">小鳥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ことり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">小鸟；小鸟儿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鳥居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とりい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鸟居（神社的牌坊门）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">飯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>米饭；饭食</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">めし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">御飯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">米饭；煮好的饭；餐；饭食</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕飯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晚餐；晚饭；夜饭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">晩御飯</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばんごはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晚餐；晚饭</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勉</div><div class=\"k-bod