ja\">ひるごはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">午餐；中餐；午饭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">昼間</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひるま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">白天；日间；白昼；从日出到日落的时间</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">茶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>茶</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チャ・サ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お茶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おちゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">茶（尤指绿茶或麦茶）；茶歇；茶点时间；茶道</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紅茶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうちゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">红茶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">茶色</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゃいろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">褐色；浅褐色；棕色</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">弟</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>弟弟；弟子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ・ダイ・デ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おとうと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弟</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（古）（哥哥的）弟弟；（姐姐的）妹妹；最小的孩子；老幺；年轻的；较年轻的；最年轻的；年轻貌美；娇俏可爱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">兄弟</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兄弟姐妹；手足；同父异母（或同母异父）的兄弟姐妹；继兄弟姐妹；养兄弟姐妹；伙伴；朋友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">従兄弟</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いとこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">男表亲；男堂兄弟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">牛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>牛</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牛肉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎゅうにく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牛肉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牛乳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎゅうにゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牛奶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">牛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牛；黄牛；牝牛；公牛；阉牛；犊牛；牛肉；牛宿（二十八宿之一）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">魚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>鱼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うお・さかな・-ざかな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">魚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">鱼</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">金魚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんぎょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">金鱼</span></li></ul></div></li>"]